      "source_id": "D1",
      "quote": "Two different source scans; do not pool them as independent repeats.",
      "locator": "data_dictionary.scan"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "D1",
      "quote": "Fig2a uses approximately 0-100 scale; Fig2b approximately 0-1. Preserve units per scan; do not combine raw scales.",
      "locator": "data_dictionary.DOP"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "D1",
      "quote": "At dphi=0.0, DOP=93.139824; at dphi=0.41000000000000025, DOP=31.001004333333334.",
      "locator": "preview, spread scan"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "D1",
      "quote": "The source study programs optical polarization statistics using spatial light modulators.",
      "locator": "additional_context"
    }
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "type": "observation",
      "text": "提供的 spread 扫描预览中，dphi 从 0 增至约 0.41 时 DOP 从约 93.14 降至约 31.00；这是已提供测量，不是独立发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "question",
      "text": "mean_phase 扫描中，DOP 是否随相位系统变化，还是近似稳定而偏振方向变化？预览不足以判断完整扫描。"
    },
    {
      "type": "hypothesis",
      "text": "条件性解释：spread 扫描的偏振度下降可能与相位分布变宽造成不同空间贡献相消相容；机制未核实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "question",
      "text": "相位分布宽度和平均相位对偏振度与偏振方向的作用，是否可在各自扫描中区分？两条扫描不可当作独立重复。"
    }
